# fd-native ignores. These patterns apply to every fd-driven gate scan.
# Vendored OpenSpec workflow skills under .agents/skills/openspec-*: committed
# for reproducibility, but installed and regenerated by the `skills`/`openspec`
# CLI, not maintained as sources of this repository. Markdown lint/format gates
# skip them here and in the lefthook pre-commit markdown job; the path-based
# exclusion survives `skills update` regeneration.
# (see openspec/changes/migrate-commit-msg-spec)
.agents/skills/openspec-*
